# The ninth battle (stage 8) won by play, from the original's save after
# stage 7. The story to the choice of two paths; the second (the forest
# path) chosen. Hands-off nothing wins it: the lance waits at its start and
# the road group parks across the road. The scene's win is checked only once
# a unit of the pass group (12-15) or the road group's leader (20) has been
# attacked: the lance leader (unit 0) standing on column 143 then wins it.
# So the leader is sent across the map toward the lake past that column, and
# the second unit (F2), its fire mode set to fire on any enemy, is sent
# south at the pass group: its fight arms the check before the leader
# crosses the column, and the battle is won at 10:36. Every order is given
# while the battle waits (a unit's commands are up); the keys that land in
# the running battle wait for a step (steps:1), and a message is answered
# with no idle after it.
# Then the menu over the battle: Save & Continue to slot 1: the save is
# REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_08.
# set: campaign
# start-save: REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_07
# Load Game, slot 1; the story to the choice of two paths.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right idle:50 Return idle:300
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story1
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story2
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story3
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story4
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story5
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story6
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story7
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story8
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story9
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_story10
Return idle:600 @snap:stage8_paths
# The second path, the forest; the battle from 10:31.
Right idle:100 @snap:stage8_forest
Return steps:2 @snap:stage8_battle
# The leader's Commands (F1), Move: the cursor 57 cells down and right, then
# 101 right (the lake, past column 143); the order given (Done).
